Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the focused pool1 to see if trimming reduces noise and improves over mean/weighted for this highly seasonal, high‑outlier series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

